 meat-based dishes and side vegetables. This recipe is an interpreted method from the original recipe in Henry Hartshorne's the Household Cyclopedia. \n==Ingredients==\n* [[Cookbook:Veal|Veal]] slices\n* [[Cookbook:Ham|Ham]] slices \n* 2 [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Parsnip|parsnips]]\n* 2 cloves of [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n* 500 ml [[Cookbook:Broth|broth]]\n* 175 ml white [[Cookbook:Wine|wine]]\n* 2 slices of [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine veal, ham, onions, parsnips, garlic, and cloves in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]]. \n# Add broth, wine, and lemon slices.\n# [[Cookbook:Simmering|Simmer]] over low heat for 15 to 20 minutes, or until reduced. \n# [[Cookbook:Sieve|Sieve]] the sauce and serve. \n\n==References==\n\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments]]\n[[Category:Household Cyclopedia sauce recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using veal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wine]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parsnip]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ham]]\n\n{{Hartshorne}}","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Common Sauce (Hartshorne)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Veal slices","sourceText":"Veal slices","amountText":"Veal slices","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Ham slices","sourceText":"Ham slices","amountText":"Ham slices","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 onions","sourceText":"2 onions","amountText":"2 onions","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 parsnips","sourceText":"2 parsnips","amountText":"2 parsnips","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 cloves of garlic","sourceText":"2 cloves of garlic","amountText":"2 cloves of garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 cloves","sourceText":"2 cloves","amountText":"2 cloves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"500 ml broth","sourceText":"500 ml broth","amountText":"500 ml broth","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"175 ml white wine","sourceText":"175 ml white wine","amountText":"175 ml white wine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"2 slices of lemon","sourceText":"2 slices of lemon","amountText":"2 slices of lemon","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Combine veal, ham, onions, parsnips, garlic, and cloves in a large saucepan.","sourceText":"Combine veal, ham, onions, parsnips, garlic, and cloves in a large saucepan.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Add broth, wine, and lemon slices.","sourceText":"Add broth, wine, and lemon slices.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Simmer over low heat for 15 to 20 minutes, or until reduced.","sourceText":"Simmer over low heat for 15 to 20 minutes, or until reduced.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"Sieve the sauce and serve.","sourceText":"Sieve the sauce and serve.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:448088","recordId":"wikibooks-448088-r4518892","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4518892","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Common%20Sauce%20(Hartshorne)&oldid=4518892","sourceSha256":"4446de24a83e7f0d15c041c8176b4f1058ab3340779f7009c347845fac